[H2] 💻 代码块演示

[Code lang=python]
# Python 代码示例
def hello(name):
    print(f"Hello, {name}!")
    return True

hello("World")
[/Code]

[Code lang=javascript]
// JavaScript 代码示例
function greet(name) {
    console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);
    return true;
}

greet("World");
[/Code]

